  "course_summary": "ISEN 645 | Lean Engineering | Fall 2026\nInstructor: Michael Graul | mgraul@tamu.edu\nMeets: N/A | Online\nGrading: Quizzes [15%], Homework [15%], Midterm exam [35%], Project Work [35%] — A: [90,100] B: [80-90) C: [70,80) D: [60,70) F: [0,60)\nTopics: 6σ, Kanban, Kaizen, LPS (Lean Production System) maintenance, single-piece flow, quantity control, waste accounting, PS 'health' monitoring, variability reduction, SE architectures, factory physics principles",
